      "content": "SP 90 NW                   CHARTRIDGE           BELLINGDON                                                 (east side) 2/17                                            Barn to North                                                 of Bellingdon Farmhouse 2.5.78 GV                                              II Barn.  C18.  Timber framed on brick plinth, weatherboarded, old tile roof.  Projecting gabled cart entry on north-east side with outshots each side.  Interior:  3 bays, curved braces, double purlin roof, with struts and collars. Listing NGR: SP9413005590"
